\n    <ol class="explorer-steps" aria-label="Seat explorer steps">\n      <li class="explorer-step is-current" data-explorer-step="venue"><span>1</span><div><strong data-i18n="explorer.stepVenue">Choose a venue</strong><small data-i18n="explorer.stepVenueHint">Start with a country, region, and venue.</small></div></li>\n      <li class="explorer-step" data-explorer-step="ticket"><span>2</span><div><strong data-i18n="explorer.stepTicket">Enter your ticket</strong><small data-i18n="explorer.stepTicketHint">Use the section, row, and seat exactly as printed.</small></div></li>\n      <li class="explorer-step" data-explorer-step="view"><span>3</span><div><strong data-i18n="explorer.stepView">Review your view</strong><small data-i18n="explorer.stepViewHint">Switch between 2D, 3D, and audience view.</small></div></li>\n    </ol>\n    <section class="input-panel" aria-labelledby="ticket-form-title">\n      <div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">STEP 1–2</span><h2 id="ticket-form-title" data-i18n="explorer.formTitle">Find your seat</h2></div><p id="venue-status" class="panel-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>\n      <form id="ticket-form" class="toolbar" aria-label="Find a ticket seat">\n        <div class="venue-picker"><label><span data-i18n="explorer.countryLabel">Country / region</span><select id="venue-country" required disabled><option data-i18n="explorer.loadingVenue">Loading venues…</option></select></label><label><span data-i18n="explorer.venueLabel">Venue</span><select id="venue" required disabled><option data-i18n="explorer.loadingVenue">Loading venues…</option></select></label></div>\n        <label class="section-field"><span data-i18n="explorer.ticketSection">Section / block</span><input id="section" list="section-list" autocomplete="off" value="122" maxlength="40" required aria-describedby="ticket-format"><small data-i18n="explorer.sectionHint">Copy the label from your ticket.</small><datalist id="section-list"></datalist></label>\n        <label class="row-field"><span data-i18n="explorer.ticketRow">Row</span><input id="row" autocomplete="off" value="14" maxlength="40" required aria-describedby="ticket-format"></label>\n        <label class="seat-field"><span data-i18n="explorer.ticketSeat">Seat</span><input id="seat" autocomplete="off" value="679" maxlength="40" required aria-describedby="ticket-format"></label>\n        <button type="submit" id="locate" class="primary" data-i18n="explorer.locate">Find my seat <span>↗</span></button>\n        <p id="ticket-format" class="form-help" data-i18n="explorer.ticketHint">Example: Section 101 · Row A · Seat 78. Labels are matched to available source records.</p>\n      </form>\n      <button type="button" id="venue-retry" class="secondary retry-button" hidden data-i18n="common.retry">Try again</button>\n    </section>\n    <div class="workspace">\n      <section class="map-card" data-explorer-step-panel="view" aria-labelledby="venue-name">\n        <div class="map-heading"><div><h2 id="venue-name">Loading</h2><p id="venue-city"></p></div><div class="switch" aria-label="Map mode"><button id="mode-2d">2D seating chart</button><button id="mode-3d" class="active">3D view</button></div></div>\n        <div id="viewer" class="viewer"><canvas id="scene" aria-label="Interactive 3D venue"></canvas><svg id="map" viewBox="-190 -145 380 290" role="group" tabindex="0" aria-label="2D venue map with selectable sections" hidden></svg>\n          <button id="fullscreen" class="fullscreen-control" aria-label="Full screen">⛶</button>\n          <div class="viewer-controls"><div id="view-tools" class="view-tools"><button id="overview" class="active">Venue overview</button><button id="seat-view">Audience view</button><button id="near">Go to section</button><button id="reset">Reset</button><button id="roof-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Roof illustration</button><button id="phone-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Phone framing</button></div>\n          <div id="camera-tools" class="camera-tools" hidden><span>View zoom · Geometric estimate</span><button data-zoom="1" class="active">1×</button><button data-zoom="2">2×</button><button data-zoom="5">5×</button><button data-zoom="8">8×</button></div>\n          <div id="map-tools" class="map-tools" hidden><output id="map-zoom-value" aria-label="Map zoom">100%</output><button id="map-zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="map-zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">＋</button><button id="map-rotate" aria-label="Rotate map">↻</button><button id="map-reset">Reset</button></div>\n          <div id="map-levels" class="map-levels" role="group" aria-label="2D stand levels" hidden></div><div class="selection-row"><span id="selection-tag" class="selection-tag">Section 122</span></div><span id="viewer-location" class="viewer-location"></span></div>\n          <div id="camera-reticle" class="camera-reticle" hidden><i></i><span>4:3 phone frame · Simulated view</span></div><span id="roof-note" class="roof-note" hidden>Illustrative roof · Not a measured building model</span><div id="view-error" class="view-error" hidden></div>\n          <span id="gesture-hint" class="gesture-hint">Drag to rotate · Pinch to zoom / pan · Select a section</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class="map-footer"><div class="legend"><span><i></i><span data-i18n="explorer.legendSections">Venue sections</span></span><span><i class="orange"></i><span data-i18n="explorer.legendCurrent">Selected section</span></span><span><i class="gold"></i><span data-i18n="explorer.legendSource">Source sample</span></span></div><span id="coverage-count"></span></div>\n        <details class="sources"><summary>Sources and location accuracy <span id="accuracy-short">Geometry not yet calibrated</span></summary><p id="coverage-note"></p><p>Green chairs illustrate the stands. Ticket matches use source records. Unknown labels stay unverified; distances depend on venue and event-stage calibration.</p><a id="source-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source ↗</a></details>\n      </section>\n      <aside>\n  '... 8176 more characters,
